   "currency": "GBP",
   "availability": "in_stock",
   "description": "Bold, bright and unapologetically fun. The Watersprite range brings a matte green dial to the Newmark collection for the first time — paired with black applied indices filled with Super-LumiNova X1-C3 that glow brilliantly in the dark. This isn't a reissue. It's a brand new Newmark, inspired by the brand's rich archive of colourful historic models and brought into the present day with modern specs and serious wrist appeal. The 316L stainless steel case measures 42.5mm x 36mm, giving it a distinctive silhouette that sits differently from anything else in the collection. A double-domed sapphire crystal sits on top, the TMI NH38 automatic movement ticks away inside, and 100m of water resistance means it can handle real life without worry. The Watersprite arrives on a smooth silicone rubber strap in a tropic style with a stainless steel tang buckle — lightweight, waterproof and comfortable from the first wear. With an 18mm lug width, it's also the perfect canvas for your favourite third-party straps. With dials this colourful, mixing and matching is half the fun. Only 50 of each colour Watersprite are available. Each is individually numbered. When they're gone, they're gone. Free worldwide shipping on every order and 0% interest available with Klarna.",
